// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Apex 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Apex 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P273280760" "Apex"
// ProfessionString :
"P834376370" "Vanguard Commander"
// LocationString :
"P980288551" "Rikti War Zone"
// DescriptionString :
"P2003892861" "Apex was recommended to Vanguard by the Back Alley Brawler, who accounted Apex's brave stand alongside War Witch and a man named Horus against Requiem. Vanguard recruited Apex and assigned him to their division regarding Praetoria. Apex has had to do many investigations and missions into Praetoria alone, given the sensitive nature of the situation. The years that he has worked have forged him into a capable fighter and strategist, making him one of Vanguard's top resources when it comes to all Praetorian matters.<br><br>With the Praetorian invasion coming to light, Apex and his work with Vanguard can now finally be revealed to the general public, much to Apex's relief."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P191182632" "I'm afraid you do not have clearance to handle my tasks.<br><br><color orange>You must become a VIP subscriber in order to access this contact."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P2960226351" "Good to see you're here with a team, {HeroName}. My name is Apex, I'm in charge of Vanguard's operations against Praetoria. As you may or may not know, we've got ourselves into <i>another</i> invasion. Looks like people just love to attack Primal Earth, huh? First it was Rikti, now it's <color yellow>Praetoria.</color><br><br> Their first attack was on Terra Volta, and it was <i>bad</i>, {HeroName}. Everyone from the Freedom Phalanx was there, fighting tooth and nail against the Praetorians. Eventually, they were forced to retreat, and the Praetorians shut down Terra Volta for some time.<br><br>That's the odd thing, though. They could've blown it up, but they just chose to shut it down for a time... which means that whatever they wanted to do, they did in that time. This is where you and your team come in, {HeroName}."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P2506791524" "Sorry, {HeroName}, you'll need to be at least Security Level 50 to handle the current situation with the Praetorians."
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P856364347" ""
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P3130494591" "This situation with the Praetorians is pretty dire, {HeroName}. <color yellow>You'll need a full team of eight people to handle what's coming our way.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P1276272344" "Sorry, {HeroName}, but I'll need to speak with your team leader. No offense."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P3615052088" "Let me know when all of your team is assembled here in the War Zone."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P1758564936" "Someone in your squad isn't at Securty Level 50, {HeroName}. I can't risk someone getting hurt in this situation."
// TaskForceName :
"P2621260532" "Task Force Kings"
// TaskForceName :
"P2424593091" "Task Force Horus"
// TaskForceName :
"P1088944727" "Task Force Razor"
// TaskForceName :
"P3911661672" "Task Force Barrera"
// HelloString :
"P1514996782" "Good to speak with you all again. Let us get moving."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P886418304" "We doubt that this text shall ever appear in-game, as you should not be able to see Our IDontKnowYouString."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2681622762" "You should never see this text"
// IntroString :
"P3462422106" "We would not be introduced in such a manner."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P815427847" "We do not do introductions."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


