// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Borea 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Borea 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4062079347" "Borea"
// ProfessionString :
"P3049281721" "Co-Leader of Vanguard Shield Division"
// DescriptionString :
"P3321733432" "Borea and her twin sister Levantera together lead the Shield, the division of Vanguard tasked with protecting the city and it's people from the Rikti. The two sisters are both extremely capable fighters, and are the chosen Champions of the Order of the Four Winds. However, the sisters rarely see eye-to-eye with each other, and often argue over the best methods to accomplish their goals. Borea tends to believe in a protective strategy, concentrating on defending the city and it's citizens over aggressive pre-emptive attacks. After all, if your enemy has destroyed what you were protecting, then any victory is meaningless."
// HelloString :
"P1390269611" "There's a lot of city to save. You ready?"
// HelloString :
"P611157682" "The Rikti aren't stopping, and there's a lot to do."
// HelloString :
"P4151217354" "Let's see if we can find something for you to do."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1658622802" "Funny thing is, I'm an auto-issue contact, so you should probably never see this."
// FirstVisitString :
"P503349163" "I'm Borea.  I lead the Vanguard Shield Division, along with my sister Levantera. The Shield is all about defending the Earth and this city from the Rikti. We're always looking for people to help out. If you're any good, that is."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P930484285" "Actually, you should probably never see this text. Ain't that funny?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1515917776" "Is this some kind of joke to you? Come back when you get some of your other tasks done. I don't need someone who can't concentrate on the mission."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4247334032" "You're a little eager.  You see that hospital over there?  That's what happens when you mess with the Rikti before level 35. Now, go home to your trainer and come back when you're ready."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1934033415" "I heard you were good. I guess the rumors were true."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P396806231" "You're really making a name for yourself in Vanguard. Keep it up, and you're gonna go places."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4198709500" "I don't think it's possible for you to ever see this, unless we raise the level cap or something."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P680195587" "Borea is a co-commander of the Vanguard Shield. The Rikti are relentless, and she can always use assistance from people with power."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P734022636" "Meet Borea"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1350364653" "Borea always has something for a Vanguard volunteer to do. Check in with her whenever you need a mission."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4020465395" "I really don't do introductions."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


