// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Dark_Watcher 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Dark Watcher 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3964152796" "Dark Watcher"
// ProfessionString :
"P120334523" "Mysterious Man in Black"
// DescriptionString :
"P71432900" "Many rumors swirl around the Dark Watcher.  Some claim that he's a federal agent who learned too much and went renegade.  Others say that he's an immortal being who walks the treacherous path between worlds under his own power.  Still others say that he is not a human being at all.  Whatever the truth, he has appeared time and again to help the heroes of Earth fend off enemies ranging from the Rikti to the Rularuu.  Normally, he disappears after his job is done, but for reasons unknown he has stayed with Vanguard since the group's inception, acting as Lady Grey's loyal advisor."
// HelloString :
"P1097992599" "Hello."
// HelloString :
"P798264404" "Good afternoon."
// HelloString :
"P1148099156" "Good evening."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1537500966" "No.  I don't know you well enough.  Talk to someone else here."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1461850273" "I'm the Watcher.  You're {HeroName}.  I know what you can do.  You know I'll help you do it.  Let's get started."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3126194401" "The danger has been averted, for today.  That doesn't mean the fight's over.  If you want more to do, get a team together and talk to Lady Grey."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P589667412" "Finish some of your other tasks before you come back.  Then we can talk."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2710090778" "I need you to be at least a 45.  Come back when you are."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P82269762" "You do some very respectable work."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P570958619" "I really respect and appreciate the effort you've put into this."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3892937086" "It's impossible to see this FailsafeString in game."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P684077876" "The Dark Watcher is, well, the Dark Watcher.  He's been acting as Lady Grey's advisor ever since Vanguard was founded.  He rarely asks anything from anyone, so I think this is a pretty big deal."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3852440611" "Meet the Dark Watcher"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P389877374" "Whatever the Watcher is working on, it's big.  Good luck!"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2724552403" "I don't do introductions."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


