// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Gaussian 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Gaussian 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1715911877" "Gaussian"
// ProfessionString :
"P3692065566" "Vanguard Tactician"
// DescriptionString :
"P2187202314" "Gaussian is Vanguard's main tactician, coordinating intelligence efforts across Divisions to form a united front against the Rikti.  Many believe that his ability to keep Vanguard organized is the only thing that's prevented the Rikti from overwhelming Vanguard's forces, but Gaussian prefers to downplay his role and instead credit the steadfast determination and fighting skill of the volunteer troops."
// HelloString :
"P920015562" "Alright, let's get this cloak-and-dagger stuff done."
// HelloString :
"P197182699" "We've got a lot to do."
// HelloString :
"P4124785633" "Let's do this."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1429452133" "I'm glad to meet you, {HeroName}, but I'm a bit busy right now.  I'll talk to you later, but hey, if you're looking for something to do, maybe you should talk to Levantera or Borea."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2229043088" "Alright, let's get this out of the way.  My title is tactician, but I'm also in charge of Vanguard's cloak-and-dagger stuff.  I've been watching your work, so I know you can handle weird situations, and that you have a tendency to come out on top despite the odds.  That sounds like just the kind of person I need right now."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P576095251" "It's gonna be a while before I can get myself out of the doghouse, but don't worry about me.  Right now, I think you may have some bigger things to worry about.  I'll see you around."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1333430658" "We have a problem.  Simply put, you already have too much to do.  Go and finish up some of your other tasks, then hurry back."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2411438501" "Drummer said that you had an impressive record, and I have to agree.  However, I need something just a bit more impressive.  Like, about 45 security or threat levels worth of impressive.  I'll see you when you're ready."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P947029130" "Things may look bleak, but you're doing great."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P732575730" "This isn't over yet, but with you around I think we just might have a chance."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1818365106" "I don't know how you could be seeing my FailsafeLevelString.  Did they raise the level cap?"
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P890724729" "Gaussian, our lead tactician, was very specific when he asked to speak to you.  However, he did not tell me what it was he wished to speak with you about."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2841350642" "Meet Gaussian"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P800609896" "I have worked with Gaussian for years now, and I still do not know all that he does for Vanguard.  I believe that this request is of the highest importance, and would suggest you give it all due attention."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P20942926" "The Dark Watcher doesn't make requests lightly."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


