// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : The Lady Grey 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1355872564" "The Lady Grey"
// ProfessionString :
"P1623418185" "Leader of the Vanguard"
// LocationString :
// DescriptionString :
"P3329442404" "Ever composed, ever mysterious, the powerful and otherworldly Lady Grey is rumored to be older than Lord Recluse, and one of the most powerful meta-humans on the planet.  She was instrumental in the founding of Vanguard, and runs the organization expertly.  She takes a great interest in Vanguard's day-to-day operations, and knows all of her troops by name."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P732233873" "Greetings, volunteers.  It is Our distinct pleasure to invite you to participate in a great Task; and join a force to help overthrow the machinations of the Rikti and return order to our embattled world."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P490292423" "We are terribly sorry, but We must decline your application for this Task Force.  We are afraid that you simply do not have sufficient power to join in this great undertaking.  When you have achieved a minimum of 45th level, you may return, and We shall be happy to welcome you then. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need 8 heroes or villains on your team, all at least Level 45, in order to begin this Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P2047805546" "It is highly unlikely that you should ever see this text, barring the raising of the level cap. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need 8 heroes and villains on your team, all at least Level 45, in order to begin this Task Force.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P2927842945" "We admire your valor, but We must take account of your safety as well.  Without a sufficiently large team of companions, We would be sending you to your certain doom. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need 8 heroes or villains on your team, all of them at least Level 45, in order to begin this Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P607800819" "If you ready, then We would speak with the leader of your team so that We may begin. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need 8 heroes or villains on your team, all at least Level 45, in order to begin this Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P3291802308" "We are afraid that not all the members of your team are present.  Please gather your forces into this zone, and then you may begin. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need 8 heroes or villains on your team, all at least Level 45, in order to begin this Task Force.</color>"
// BadTeamLevel :
"P3942471310" "We are afraid that some members of your team do not have sufficient power to participate in this great task.  Please correct this, and We shall be happy to work with you. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need 8 heroes or villains on your team, all at least Level 45, in order to begin this Task Force.</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P3656390541" "Task Force Hastings"
// TaskForceName :
"P3198163175" "Task Force Agincourt"
// TaskForceName :
"P4076410720" "Task Force Waterloo"
// TaskForceName :
"P3241737927" "Task Force Trafalgar"
// TaskForceName :
"P1207134456" "Task Force Jutland"
// HelloString :
"P3652363894" "Are we ready?"
// HelloString :
"P1191503083" "Is everyone prepared?"
// HelloString :
"P2552587615" "Hold steady, everyone."
// IDontKnowYouString :
// FirstVisitString :
"P3950274873" "Task Force code-names were one of Our organizational techniques we first used during the Rikti War. It pleases Us that they have continued, and it is Our honor to grant to you the code-name {TaskForceName}."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1603975182" "You have performed beyond all expectation, and have Our sincerest thanks."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P738903856" "Your performance has been beyond admirable.  However, there is still much that must be accomplished."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P468787601" "Your courage and daring have carried the day time and again, yet the great work is not over.  Indeed, the most difficult tasks may yet be to come."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P435102582" "It is plainly impossible for Our FailSafeLevelString to appear in game.  Such foolishness should be reported immediately."
// IntroString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


