// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Levantera 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2706099738" "Levantera"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P4096676826" "Levantera and her twin sister Borea lead the Shield, the division of Vanguard tasked with protecting the city and its people from the Rikti.  The two sisters are both extremely capable fighters, and are the chosen Champions of the Order of the Four Winds.  However, the sisters rarely see eye-to-eye with each other, and often argue over the best methods to accomplish their goals.  While Levantera likes to cultivate a more cultured appearance than her sister, she's also the more offensively-minded of the two.  She believes that the best kind of counter-attack is a pre-emptive one.  After all, if your enemies are all dead, then they can't hurt your friends."
// HelloString :
"P3915574973" "We must ...'protect' ourselves from the Invader."
// HelloString :
"P31925068" "Constant vigilance is the price we must pay."
// HelloString :
"P4127893782" "The Invader seeks our world.  I hope you're ready to stop them."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P805142686" "Very interesting.  Since I'm an Auto-issue contact, you should never see my IDontKnowYouString.  Ooh, it makes me feel a bit naked."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3777759602" "It's good to meet you, {HeroName}.  Let me be the first to welcome you to the Vanguard.  That is, if you want to join us..."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P913930766" "Well, we certainly had quite a time, didn't we?  I think there are others who need your assistance now more than I do.  We've got things covered."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P4251158470" "You come to me with all these other things to do, and expect me to give you more?  I don't know if you're being over-eager or just impertinent.  Why don't you just go take care of your other problems, then come back when you're ready to pay attention."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P124267215" "My, my, my.  Aren't you the anxious one?  Well, I'd like to accept your offer of assistance, but you're just not ready yet.  Maybe when you're about 35th level.  Come back then."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P635699455" "You're progressing very well already."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1886865136" "You've become something of a sensation among our new recruits.  Keep it up and you'll go far."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2472804946" "How is it that you can see my FailsafeLevelString?  That should be impossible, unless we've raised the level cap or you're peeking through .pigg files."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P919994420" "Levantera is a co-commander of the Vanguard Shield. The Rikti are relentless so she can always use assistance from people with power."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3918058948" "Meet Levantera"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2341516454" "The Vanguard are our first line of defense against the Rikti.  Levantera can use all the help she can find to fight them."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3024254230" "<color deepskyblue>Serpent Drummer</color> would like to speak with you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2689447465" "Several people want to meet you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


