// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Serpent Drummer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3965825189" "Serpent Drummer"
// ProfessionString :
"P2052518008" "Leader of the Vanguard Gauntlet"
// DescriptionString :
"P3479032421" "The enigmatic man called Serpent Drummer is the head of the Vanguard's Gauntlet division.  The Gauntlet was originally Vanguard's offensive division, but changing events have seen it shift those responsibilities to the Shield Division, while the Gauntlet concentrates on coordinating Vanguard's forces with the recent influx of super-powered volunteers.  Even in the middle of such great changes, Serpent Drummer remains serene."
// HelloString :
"P856719880" "Greetings."
// HelloString :
"P491691779" "There is much to do."
// HelloString :
"P1131363825" "I hope you have prepared yourself."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P820807564" "I am afraid that I do not know enough about you to put your abilities to their best use.  Perhaps you should speak with Levantera?  She can be found in the hall across from the Armory."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1453104945" "I think it will be very good to work with you, {HeroName}, but this is not the time for pleasant chit-chat.  I have some very important issues where I could use, well, someone like you."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2378954758" "You have done exceedingly well, and I must congratulate you.  Now, however, I must work to ready the Gauntlet for the future.  And you, I think, have even greater things ahead of you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1977772780" "There is not much to it; you simply already have too much to do.  It would be best if you finished some other matters first before you returned to me."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P656724237" "I apologize to you, {HeroName}, but I am afraid that I must ask you to wait a bit before we begin working together.  I would suggest that you take some time to settle other matters first, then return to me.  Perhaps when you are around Level 40.  Yes, that should be about right."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1420157791" "I saw a capacity for greatness in you, and I am glad that I was not wrong."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P704699131" "You draw the admiration of our allies and the ire of our enemies.  Excellent."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P125564661" "Unless the level cap has been raised, it is highly unlikely that you should ever see my FailsafePlayerLevel text.  Curious."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P4135940922" "Serpent Drummer is the head of the Gauntlet.  I believe that he's currently in the middle of some sort of high-end negotiations, but I don't know much more than that.  Well, other than that he asked to see you by name."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2729753818" "Meet Serpent Drummer"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1527727818" "Whatever Serpent Drummer is doing, I know that it's very important.  I think you'll have a good time."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3679520294" "<color deepskyblue>Gaussian</color> wishes to hold an audience with you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3761095115" "You've been very specifically asked for."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


