// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Tin_Mage 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Tin Mage Mark II 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1279199815" "Tin Mage Mark II"
// ProfessionString :
"P3481788923" "Vanguard Tactician "
// LocationString :
// DescriptionString :
"P1324471388" "Tin Mage Mark II was created from the blueprints of the original Tin Mage, who was one of the members of the Omega Team. Tin Mage's blueprints were discovered when the Omega Team's time capsule was opened in the year 2009. Vanguard has since rebuilt Tin Mage based off of the blueprints and have used him as one of their main tactician's in the war against any interdimensional threat against Earth."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P1536761158" "I'm sorry, but you do not have sufficient clearance level to handle these tasks.<br><br><color orange>You must become a VIP subscriber in order to access this contact."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P3513648125" "Greetings. My name is Tin Mage Mark II, the latest model of Tin Mage, rebuilt by Vanguard after my unfortunate and assumed demise at the hands of the Rikti. I have been put in charge of forming yet another assault on an alternate dimension. Perhaps it's due to my experience in attacking other dimensions. Or, rather, the experience of my former make.<br><br>Regardless, the assistance of you and your team is needed on this day. Before we can take the fight to Praetoria, we need to form a united front here in Primal Earth. This means <i>Arachnos</i>. Currently, they are having a dire situation with the Praetorian invasion within Nerva Archipelago. These islands have been disputed for quite some time.<br><br>Vanguard would like to enlist your aid in taking back Nerva from the Praetorians and moving forward to strike a blow against them on their home turf."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P925954608" "The offensive on Praetoria will be very difficult, {HeroName}. <color yellow>You'll need a full team of eight people to handle what's coming our way.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P576745064" "I need to speak to your team leader, {HeroName}."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
// BadTeamLevel :
// TaskForceName :
"P1338324874" "Task Force Branforth"
// TaskForceName :
"P392583914" "Task Force Prestidigitator"
// TaskForceName :
"P2411785747" "Task Force Aegis"
